        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In the event “by-pass” time is allowed, the Analyst will be paid the number of hours at the straight time rate. The Analyst’s hours to be added to their accumulated hours will be the number of hours paid divided by 1.5, rounded off to the nearest half hour. The addition to the Analyst’s overtime hours shall be done on the day that the Analyst, or the Analyst’s Union Representative is notified that the “by-pass” payment is to be made.",
